POST http://localhost:9200/memo/_search HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": {
    "multi_match": {
      "query": "customer concentration",
      "fields": [
        "keyCommitteeDiscussionPoints^3",
        "riskFactors^2",
        "executiveSummary"
      ]
    }
  }
}

###

PUT http://localhost:9200/memo/_mapping HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "properties": {
    "commitmentDate": { "type": "date" },
    "clientType": { "type": "keyword" },
    "sponsors": { "type": "keyword" }
  }
}
